    { "id": 8, "event": "agent_progress", "delay": 120, "data": { "agentId": "agent-architect", "role": "🏗️ 架构师", "chunk": "从**可演进性**角度，" }},
    { "id": 9, "event": "agent_progress", "delay": 140, "data": { "agentId": "agent-researcher", "role": "🔬 研究员", "chunk": "SQLite 在**单写者**负载下可达数万 TPS 读，" }},
    { "id": 10, "event": "agent_progress", "delay": 140, "data": { "agentId": "agent-risk", "role": "⚖️ 风险官", "chunk": "我要提醒一个常被忽视的失败模式：" }},
    { "id": 11, "event": "agent_progress", "delay": 140, "data": { "agentId": "agent-architect", "role": "🏗️ 架构师", "chunk": "初期用 SQLite 的**迁移债**往往被低估。" }},
    { "id": 12, "event": "agent_progress", "delay": 160, "data": { "agentId": "agent-researcher", "role": "🔬 研究员", "chunk": "但一旦出现**并发写**，写锁会成为瓶颈。\n\n" }},
    { "id": 13, "event": "agent_progress", "delay": 160, "data": { "agentId": "agent-risk", "role": "⚖️ 风险官", "chunk": "如果一年内真的快速增长，`ALTER TABLE` 在百万行上的停机窗口。" }},

    { "id": 14, "event": "agent_complete", "delay": 260, "data": {
      "agent": { "agentId": "agent-researcher", "role": "🔬 研究员", "roleDescription": "循证分析，重数据与先例", "modelName": "claude-sonnet-4", "isChairman": false, "isDevilAdvocate": false },
      "result": { "response": "## 初步判断\n\n先看数据。SQLite 在**单写者**负载下可达数万 TPS 读，写入受单一写锁限制。对 3 人团队的早期产品，绝大多数负载是读多写少，SQLite 足以支撑到**数千日活**。\n\n关键拐点在于：\n\n1. **并发写** 一旦成为常态，写锁排队会显著抬高 p99 延迟；\n2. 需要**多进程/多实例**写同一份数据时，SQLite 力不从心。\n\n> 结论：以数据看，早期 SQLite 不会是瓶颈，但要预留清晰的迁移路径。", "elapsedMs": 8400, "invocationMode": "api", "timedOut": false, "tokenUsage": { "inputTokens": 620, "outputTokens": 240 } }}},
    { "id": 15, "event": "agent_complete", "delay": 240, "data": {
      "agent": { "agentId": "agent-architect", "role": "🏗️ 架构师", "roleDescription": "关注可演进性与运维成本", "modelName": "gpt-4o", "isChairman": false, "isDevilAdvocate": false },
      "result": { "response": "从**可演进性**角度，初期用 SQLite 的**迁移债**往往被低估。\n\n- 好处：零运维、单文件、本地开发极快；\n- 代价：日后迁 Postgres 要重写连接层、事务语义、类型映射（SQLite 动态类型 vs Postgres 严格类型）。\n\n我的建议是**从一开始就用 Postgres**，用 Docker Compose 一行起本地实例，把「迁移」这件事从路线图里彻底删除。运维成本在托管数据库（如 Neon/Supabase）时代已经很低。", "elapsedMs": 9100, "invocationMode": "api", "timedOut": false, "tokenUsage": { "inputTokens": 610, "outputTokens": 210 } }}},
    { "id": 16, "event": "agent_complete", "delay": 240, "data": {
      "agent": { "agentId": "agent-risk", "role": "⚖️ 风险官", "roleDescription": "唱反调，专找失败模式", "modelName": "gemini-1.5-pro", "isChairman": false, "isDevilAdvocate": true },
      "result": { "response": "我要提醒一个常被忽视的失败模式：**过早乐观**。\n\n如果一年内真的快速增长，`ALTER TABLE` 在百万行上的停机窗口、备份/恢复策略、时区与并发事务的边界，SQLite 都会让你**在最忙的时候**踩坑。\n\n但反过来说——**如果增长没如期到来**，你为 Postgres 付出的运维复杂度就是纯浪费。真正的风险不是选错数据库，而是**没有可逆的决策**。", "elapsedMs": 8800, "invocationMode": "api", "timedOut": false, "tokenUsage": { "inputTokens": 600, "outputTokens": 205 } }}},

    { "id": 17, "event": "phase", "delay": 350, "data": { "phase": "cross_examine", "index": 2, "total": 6 }},
    { "id": 18, "event": "agent_progress", "delay": 160, "data": { "agentId": "agent-architect", "role": "🏗️ 架构师", "chunk": "\n\n**回应风险官**：可逆性正是我主张 Postgres 的理由——" }},
    { "id": 19, "event": "agent_progress", "delay": 180, "data": { "agentId": "agent-architect", "role": "🏗️ 架构师", "chunk": "先上 Postgres 才是可逆的，反向迁移几乎不可逆。" }},
    { "id": 20, "event": "agent_complete", "delay": 300, "data": {
      "agent": { "agentId": "agent-architect", "role": "🏗️ 架构师", "roleDescription": "关注可演进性与运维成本", "modelName": "gpt-4o", "isChairman": false, "isDevilAdvocate": false },
      "result": { "response": "从**可演进性**角度，初期用 SQLite 的**迁移债**往往被低估。\n\n**回应风险官**：可逆性正是我主张 Postgres 的理由——先上 Postgres 才是可逆的（用得不重可随时降级心智），而「先 SQLite 再迁 Postgres」在数据量上来后几乎不可逆。用托管 Postgres，运维复杂度已被外包。", "elapsedMs": 5200, "invocationMode": "api", "timedOut": false, "tokenUsage": { "inputTokens": 720, "outputTokens": 180 } }}},

